<view class="container">
  <view class="title">🕐 我不是股神</view>
  <view class="subtitle">穿越时空，用100万挑战A股历史</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">选择穿越日期</view>
    <t-cell title="穿越到" note="{{selectedDate || '请选择日期'}}" arrow bindtap="onDatePickerShow" />
    <t-date-time-picker
      visible="{{datePickerVisible}}"
      mode="date"
      title="选择穿越日期"
      start="2010-01-01"
      end="2024-12-31"
      bindconfirm="onDateConfirm"
      bindcancel="onDateCancel"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">游戏时长</view>
    <view class="duration-options">
      <t-button theme="{{duration === '1month' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}" size="small" data-duration="1month" bindtap="onDurationChange">1个月</t-button>
      <t-button theme="{{duration === '3month' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}" size="small" data-duration="3month" bindtap="onDurationChange">3个月</t-button>
      <t-button theme="{{duration === '1year' ? 'primary' : 'default'}}" size="small" data-duration="1year" bindtap="onDurationChange">1年</t-button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">初始资金</view>
    <view class="cash-display">¥ 1,000,000</view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-area">
    <t-button theme="primary" size="large" block loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="startGame">开始穿越</t-button>
  </view>

  <view class="nav-links">
    <t-button theme="light" size="small" bindtap="goRank">🏆 排行榜</t-button>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">⚠️ 免责声明：本小程序仅为历史数据模拟游戏，所有交易均为虚拟操作，不构成任何投资建议。股市有风险，入市需谨慎。</view>
</view>
